<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>South Atlantic War - Sneaky Beakies</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;Following the successful Argentinian occupation of the Falklands Islands and South Georgia, the first steps in the UK military response was to start&amp;nbsp;to gain ground-level intelligence on the occupying forces.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;This scenario is playable by the UK side only and re-creates the covert insertion of SBS reconnaisance teams by the SSN HMS Conqueror on the night of 18/19 April 1982.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
